{
  "primary": [
    {
      "speaker": "6829",
      "source_id": "6829-68769-0039",
      "chapter": "68769",
      "transcript": "HE LOOKED UP RATHER UNGRACIOUSLY BUT MOTIONED THEM TO BE SEATED",
      "transcript_file_sha256": "2396a42bef1490f31a75793b8cb28498a97e8d7c9c0aa7013c51d8ef40d3c323"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "6829",
      "source_id": "6829-68769-0007",
      "chapter": "68769",
      "transcript": "BUT UNDER THE CIRCUMSTANCES I DOUBT IF SUCH AN ARRANGEMENT COULD BE MADE",
      "transcript_file_sha256": "2396a42bef1490f31a75793b8cb28498a97e8d7c9c0aa7013c51d8ef40d3c323"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "8555",
      "source_id": "8555-284447-0022",
      "chapter": "284447",
      "transcript": "I HAD A NOTION IT WAS YOU MATE AS SAVED ME FROM THE KNIFE",
      "transcript_file_sha256": "9346b47eb25093e37093c3c51ca8a39b1ec6dffb134abfcbe921b437ed6bb5bf"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "8555",
      "source_id": "8555-292519-0013",
      "chapter": "292519",
      "transcript": "THAT WAS BUT RUSTLING OF DRIPPING PLANTS IN THE DARK",
      "transcript_file_sha256": "514d0bc0cc993568e03469e02e4058ed6a98bd4b84b3519743a1d5b3db02f8d5"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "5142",
      "source_id": "5142-33396-0035",
      "chapter": "33396",
      "transcript": "DID YOU EVER HAVE SUCH A LORDLY GUEST BEFORE I WENT ON",
      "transcript_file_sha256": "1f6981a0465e48a97e513d22a195f48a382f12a8feb813eadfab82b507eadc1a"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "5142",
      "source_id": "5142-33396-0037",
      "chapter": "33396",
      "transcript": "HAKON THERE SHALL BE YOUR CONSTANT COMPANION FRIEND FARMER",
      "transcript_file_sha256": "1f6981a0465e48a97e513d22a195f48a382f12a8feb813eadfab82b507eadc1a"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "1221",
      "source_id": "1221-135766-0013",
      "chapter": "135766",
      "transcript": "PEARL WAS A BORN OUTCAST OF THE INFANTILE WORLD",
      "transcript_file_sha256": "388486b3bc2cf35761d8796c27362c7055fdbe9ed56120476ba92e4e03e41fe2"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "1221",
      "source_id": "1221-135766-0014",
      "chapter": "135766",
      "transcript": "PEARL SAW AND GAZED INTENTLY BUT NEVER SOUGHT TO MAKE ACQUAINTANCE",
      "transcript_file_sha256": "388486b3bc2cf35761d8796c27362c7055fdbe9ed56120476ba92e4e03e41fe2"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "8224",
      "source_id": "8224-274381-0011",
      "chapter": "274381",
      "transcript": "HIS CONDUCT AND PRESENCE OF MIND IN THIS EMERGENCE APPEARED CONSPICUOUS",
      "transcript_file_sha256": "c2ad51b6cfb84e29aa4830de7e5ddce6d0791c290ffe0ca10d2684ac7be6d10c"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "8224",
      "source_id": "8224-274384-0003",
      "chapter": "274384",
      "transcript": "OR HATH HE GIVEN US ANY GIFT",
      "transcript_file_sha256": "16e65b86d260585980b6ec8c7cd670f977ca565768c7dc30b7447cde58b2cd10"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "7176",
      "source_id": "7176-88083-0016",
      "chapter": "88083",
      "transcript": "STRAIGHTWAY THE HAWK GLIDED FROM HIS PERCH AND DARTED AFTER HIM",
      "transcript_file_sha256": "9ad86ac8e977992ce3419e19c4b1977f67845a004090d97d92c4002e3143bd9f"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "7176",
      "source_id": "7176-92135-0024",
      "chapter": "92135",
      "transcript": "TO BE OR NOT TO BE THAT IS THE QUESTION WHETHER TIS NOBLER",
      "transcript_file_sha256": "e520a45b9cca9ea5f2eefd311780ee92428d3e76917d637f8b851229b2072939"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "1188",
      "source_id": "1188-133604-0035",
      "chapter": "133604",
      "transcript": "THUS IN CHAUCER'S DREAM",
      "transcript_file_sha256": "d833bb07d79d40debbbfeb5bd7d1a290ff6aa04974fb1f907108a50cf833981a"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "1188",
      "source_id": "1188-133604-0031",
      "chapter": "133604",
      "transcript": "THERE'S ONE AND THERE'S ANOTHER THE DUDLEY AND THE FLINT",
      "transcript_file_sha256": "d833bb07d79d40debbbfeb5bd7d1a290ff6aa04974fb1f907108a50cf833981a"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "4970",
      "source_id": "4970-29093-0000",
      "chapter": "29093",
      "transcript": "YOU'LL NEVER DIG IT OUT OF THE ASTOR LIBRARY",
      "transcript_file_sha256": "5ca80e9bdbd2283731a206554f4012bedbb31b9840949a6faa2fb86783bbdaed"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "4970",
      "source_id": "4970-29093-0017",
      "chapter": "29093",
      "transcript": "I'VE BEEN READY TO GO ANYWHERE FOR SIX MONTHS",
      "transcript_file_sha256": "5ca80e9bdbd2283731a206554f4012bedbb31b9840949a6faa2fb86783bbdaed"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "121",
      "source_id": "121-121726-0008",
      "chapter": "121726",
      "transcript": "HOSE MAN'S EXCUSE FOR WETTING THE WALK",
      "transcript_file_sha256": "aef21ad2ec551651cada3748a10e592091a61e4c89effe68aca96674a1bb7f43"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "121",
      "source_id": "121-121726-0014",
      "chapter": "121726",
      "transcript": "HYPOCRITE A HORSE DEALER",
      "transcript_file_sha256": "aef21ad2ec551651cada3748a10e592091a61e4c89effe68aca96674a1bb7f43"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "4507",
      "source_id": "4507-16021-0036",
      "chapter": "16021",
      "transcript": "FACTS FORM ONE OF THESE AND IDEAS THE OTHER",
      "transcript_file_sha256": "20513a2c258dc6fb48f1bc9ea40d1c7cf25729ea2e1a027bb9fbc405dde0b371"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "4507",
      "source_id": "4507-16021-0056",
      "chapter": "16021",
      "transcript": "HOWEVER HE WHO SAYS LIGHT DOES NOT NECESSARILY SAY JOY",
      "transcript_file_sha256": "20513a2c258dc6fb48f1bc9ea40d1c7cf25729ea2e1a027bb9fbc405dde0b371"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "6930",
      "source_id": "6930-81414-0021",
      "chapter": "81414",
      "transcript": "A TERRIBLE THOUGHT FLASHED INTO MY MIND",
      "transcript_file_sha256": "320fb2fb3cdf38cc3da1a2f58bc0e62518e40dfae45f0c19ce5e3967c3ff1f99"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "6930",
      "source_id": "6930-76324-0018",
      "chapter": "76324",
      "transcript": "HE MAKES IT SORT OF COZIER",
      "transcript_file_sha256": "00fdf0f32ea7372043066d4a4f77962e38cafde8fc0cafa4e966b4d47daa2fce"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "8230",
      "source_id": "8230-279154-0039",
      "chapter": "279154",
      "transcript": "THIS KNOWLEDGE IS MEMORY IN ONE SENSE THOUGH IN ANOTHER IT IS NOT",
      "transcript_file_sha256": "e9946f6e5cedea19fd3aa45b87538af19d1958e186fc7f76884756218b42e1e2"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "8230",
      "source_id": "8230-279154-0008",
      "chapter": "279154",
      "transcript": "BUT I DO NOT THINK SUCH AN INFERENCE IS WARRANTED",
      "transcript_file_sha256": "e9946f6e5cedea19fd3aa45b87538af19d1958e186fc7f76884756218b42e1e2"
    }
  ]
}
